# A summon rather than a swing: the orb hangs there and discharges by itself,
# so the wizard casts Ice Strike the whole time. GMS's 196+5x% three times on
# six enemies, and its normal-enemy bonus of 70+5x percentage POINTS per line
# -- Beam Blade's lever, and since nothing here is a boss it always lands.
#
# 1.8s between discharges is the client's own: fifteen frames of 120ms in the
# orb's attack animation. The wiki gives the orb a duration and no rate, and
# the Korean DPM calculator models the 4th job's Lightning Spear instead.
name: "Thunder Sphere"
skill_order: 2
description:
  "Summons an orb of condensed lightning that discharges a high-voltage "
  "current at nearby enemies on its own. It cuts deeper into anything that is "
  "not a boss."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE
max_level: 20
max_enemies: 6
lines: 3
cast_interval_seconds: 1.8
base {
  skill_pct: 2.01
  normal_skill_pct: 0.75
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.05
  normal_skill_pct: 0.05
}
